# Hexdrinker at level 8 (CR 711.2): a 6/6 with protection from everything (CR 702.16e), so nothing can block it. On turn 3,
# a 4/4 at level 3, it is blocked by an Ornithopter (the control) and kills it; the five level ups after combat make it
# level 8, and on turn 5 Bot2's other Ornithopter may not block it (it blocks Bot1's Ornithopter instead, the control):
# 6 damage, so Bot2 is on 14.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Hexdrinker
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hexdrinker.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Hexdrinker)
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Activate
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Hexdrinker; Ornithopter)
! Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker)
Bot2.Block(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter > Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Power = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Hexdrinker.Counters.Level = 8
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
